OL,3,AMigrants using longer, more dangerous
OL,4,Aroutes across Channel
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government says it is bearing down
OL,7,Fon dangerous small boat crossings, with
OL,8,Ffigures showing a sharp drop in
OL,9,Farrivals this year.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
